_-calyx_935.jpg/500px-Bee_on_-calyx_935.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Bee_on_-calyx_935.jpg/500px-Bee_on_-calyx_935.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A honey bee with its proboscis extended into a calyx of goldenrod","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABee_on_-calyx_935.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Honey_comb.jpg/500px-Honey_comb.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Honey_comb.jpg/500px-Honey_comb.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Honeycomb displaying hexagonal prismatic wax cells in which honey bees store honey","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHoney_comb.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Sealed_Honey_in_frame.JPG/500px-Sealed_Honey_in_frame.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Sealed_Honey_in_frame.JPG/500px-Sealed_Honey_in_frame.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sealed frame of honey","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASealed_Honey_in_frame.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Extractor_Beekeeping.jpg/500px-Extractor_Beekeeping.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Extractor_Beekeeping.jpg/1280px-Extractor_Beekeeping.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Extractor_Beekeeping.jpg/500px-Extractor_Beekeeping.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&ut